  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "2",
    "expression": null,
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 518
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "うん。うちの学校には食堂と購買があるよ、お弁当をもってきてる子もいるけど少数派かなぁ……。うちの食堂、安くておいしいからね"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "default_expression/sad1",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 518
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "でもうちの学校、去年までは女子校だったから食堂のメニューは量がすくなめなんだよ。男の子だと、ちょっと物足りないかも？"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "2",
    "expression": "default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 518
